<title>USA: Pediatric Services stake raised by investor.</title>
<headline>Pediatric Services stake raised by investor.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ronald Baron, a New York investor said late Tuesday he raised his stake in Pediatric Services of America Inc to 1,212,000 common shares or 19.9 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Baron said his latest transactions include the purchase of 441,800 common shares between Sept 4 and Nov 4 at prices ranging from $15.6250 and $20.3750 per share.</p>
</text>
